        "official_en_sha256": "d9dc9f8ccb2aba964fcb2aae1d566924fe8202fe4470bd07eb13efe132f7cf17"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺はクリスタルを守る。\r\nお前はクリスタルを壊す。\r\nこの勝負、どっちが勝っても文句なしだ。",
        "official_en": "I want to protect the Crystal. You want to destroy it. Let the winner here decide the Crystal’s fate.",
        "real_en": "I'll protect the Crystal. You'll destroy it. No matter who wins, neither of us can complain."
      },
      "review": {
